  <title>RECALL Command (FoxPro)</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>Records</keyword>
    <keyword>RECALL command</keyword>
    <keyword>RECALL command<keyword>FoxPro</keyword></keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">RECALL Command &#160;(FoxPro)</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Purpose</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">Removes the deletion mark from records, using the rules of the FoxPro dialect. This is the FoxPro version of the <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_RECALL">RECALL</link> command.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Syntax</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">RECALL [&lt;Scope&gt;] [FOR &lt;lCondition&gt;] [WHILE &lt;lCondition&gt;] [NOOPTIMIZE] [IN &lt;WorkArea&gt; | &lt;Alias&gt;]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Arguments</para>
    <para styleclass="List"><snippet src="__Scope" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="List"><snippet src="__While" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="List"><snippet src="__For" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="List">NOOPTIMIZE<tab />Disables the optimization of the FOR clause. This clause is accepted for compatibility.</para>
    <para styleclass="List"><snippet src="__In" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Remarks</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">The clauses can be specified in any order. Without a scope, FOR or WHILE clause only the current record is recalled. With a FOR clause the default scope is ALL.</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">RECALL also visits the deleted records when <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_DELETED">SET DELETED</link> is ON, so records that are hidden by SET DELETED can still be recalled.</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">After the command has completed, the variable _TALLY contains the number of records for which the deletion mark was removed. Records that were not deleted are not counted.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Examples</para>
    <para styleclass="Code Example">USE Customers<br/>
RECALL ALL<br/>
RECALL FOR Country = "NL" IN Customers</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibRT" inline="false"/></para>
